      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In current version, It's not supported AnimatorOverrideController.\n---\n現バージョンではAnimatorOverrideControllerは未対応のようでした\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/bug-sdk-breaks-when-using-an-overridecontroller-on-gesture-layer",
